### List books
GET http://localhost:3000/livros

### Create book
POST http://localhost:3000/livros
Content-Type: application/json

{ "titulo": "O Cortiço", "autor": "Aluísio Azevedo", "isbn": "9788508040001" }

### Book availability
GET http://localhost:3000/livros/1/disponibilidade

### Create copy
POST http://localhost:3000/exemplares
Content-Type: application/json

{ "livroId": 1, "tombo": "BIB-0002" }

### List readers
GET http://localhost:3000/leitores

### Create reader
POST http://localhost:3000/leitores
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "João Souza", "matricula": "2026002", "perfil": "professor" }

### Reader history
GET http://localhost:3000/leitores/1/historico

### Create loan
POST http://localhost:3000/emprestimos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "leitorId": 1, "exemplarId": 1 }

### List active loans
GET http://localhost:3000/emprestimos?status=ativo

### Create loan again (expected 409: copy unavailable)
POST http://localhost:3000/emprestimos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "leitorId": 1, "exemplarId": 1 }

### Create loan with invalid reader (expected 404)
POST http://localhost:3000/emprestimos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "leitorId": 999, "exemplarId": 1 }

### Create loan without body fields (expected 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/emprestimos
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Create copy 2
POST http://localhost:3000/exemplares
Content-Type: application/json

{ "livroId": 1, "tombo": "BIB-0003" }

### Create copy 3
POST http://localhost:3000/exemplares
Content-Type: application/json

{ "livroId": 1, "tombo": "BIB-0004" }

### Loan copy 2 to reader 1
POST http://localhost:3000/emprestimos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "leitorId": 1, "exemplarId": 2 }

### Loan copy 3 to reader 1
POST http://localhost:3000/emprestimos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "leitorId": 1, "exemplarId": 3 }

### Loan copy 4 to reader 1 (expected 409: limit reached)
POST http://localhost:3000/emprestimos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "leitorId": 1, "exemplarId": 4 }

### Delete reader with active loans (expected 409)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/leitores/1

